      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Janna's allies gain Move Speed moving towards her. Janna deals a portion of bonus Move Speed as bonus magic damage on hit and with Zephyr.",
      "summary_zh": "迦娜的友军在朝她移动时获得移动速度。 迦娜的普攻和【和风守护】会附带一部分额外移动速度的额外魔法伤害。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
