      "summary_en": "Janna summons an air elemental that passively increases her Move Speed and enables her to pass through units. She may also activate this ability to deal damage and slow an enemy's Move Speed.",
      "summary_zh": "迦娜召唤出一个空气元素灵体，来被动地提升她的移动速度，并使她能够穿越单位。她也可以主动激活这个技能，来对一个敌人造成伤害和减速效果。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1307560:3971180"
      ]
